      "BLAKE: Oh, I wouldn't go so far as to say that. Better say I'm keeping an open mind.\nPAT: And so am I.\nBLAKE: There are no scars on the back of my head, David.\nPAT: Nor mine.",
      "BLAKE: You've met Patricia Collins, Stu.\nPAT: Of course. How are you, Professor?"
